1 0 0 1 50 365 Tm
(remodeling of bones of the vertebral skeleton. Osteoclasts are) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 343 Tm
(the cells that degrade bone to initiate normal bone remodeling) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 321 Tm
