1 0 0 1 50 431 Tm
(condition in which cells fail to respond to insulin properly.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 409 Tm
(With type 2 diabetes, the pancreas usually makes some) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 387 Tm
(insulin, but either the amount made is not enough for the) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 365 Tm
(body’s need, or the body’s cells resist it.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 343 Tm
