1 0 0 1 50 321 Tm
(dependent diabetes’ or ‘adult-onset diabetes’. The most) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 299 Tm
(common cause is a combination of excessive body weight) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 277 Tm
(and insufficient exercise.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 255 Tm
